  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Son Je-Wan was a rising star in the broadcasting world until he suddenly lost the ability to recognize faces. The loss forces him to rebuild his career as a freelancer and for three long years, every face was a blur. One day, he finally recognizes someone, Lee Jin, an assistant writer at a TV station he'd bumped into before having face blindness... whose name is also written on Je-Wan's body! Determined to reclaim his place at the top, Je-Wan proposes a contractual relationship with Jin, but things soon spiral far beyond what either of them expected...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
